<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44328" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκταῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔχομαι</span>) 
			Att.
		
		Adj. (used chiefly by Trag., cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραῖος</span>): <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>for prayer, votive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄιδου . . εὐκταίαν χάριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1387
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίτην Διὸς σωτῆρος εὐκταίαν λίβα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					55
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1060
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπῳδαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					906b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. [νύμφα</span>]
			<i>devoted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				213
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανηγύρεις εὐ</span>.,
			Lat. <i>ludi votivi</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				58.12
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκταῖα, τά</span>, <i>votive offerings, vows, prayers</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				631
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				239
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> epith. of
			gods, <i>invoked in</i> or <i>by special prayer</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρὸς εὐκταίαν Ἐρινύν, πατρόθεν εὐκταία
				φάτις</span>, of the curse <i>invoked by</i> Oedipus,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				723
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				841
			</span></i> (both lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θέμις εὐκταία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					169
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσι δυστυχοῦσιν εὐκταία θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Or.</u>
					214
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> generally,
				<i>prayed for, desired</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠώς,
				λιμένες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.242
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				9.41
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Theon</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάμος γὰρ . . εὐκταῖον κακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Mon.</u>
					102
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Sent.Vat.</u>
				35
			</span></i>; <i>desirable</i>, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκτέον</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				687e
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήβεννος</span> (of the
				<i>latus clavus)</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AJA</u>
				18.323
			</span></i> (Sardes, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴασις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					7.738
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tyr.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αίως</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἔχειν</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				5.159
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέχεσθαί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					7.2.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
